          "messageID": "msg_001",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "yo quick question, if i switch branches with git checkout while i've got uncommitted changes, does it just wipe them? pretty sure thats what happened to me last week, lost like an hour of work on the flagging feature"
        }
      ]
    },
